          </p>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          My journey in web development began with a passion for creating websites that combine great design with powerful functionality. Today, I help businesses build their digital presence through modern, scalable, and customized web solutions that are fast, reliable, and built to grow.
          </p>
          <div class="grid-2 mb-4" style="gap: 1rem;">
